ời?&lt;/i&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=16;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="20" y="430" width="900" height="34" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="21" value="Cột: Tỉnh|Dân số (nghìn) / 2019|Dân số (nghìn) / 2024&lt;br&gt;Huế|1.128|1.160" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=13;fontFamily=Courier New;align=left;spacingLeft=10;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=6;fillColor=#fffdf5;strokeColor=#bbbbbb;fontSize=12;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="460" y="470" width="510" height="56" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="22" value="→ reader returns &lt;b&gt;1.160&lt;/b&gt;: the view keeps 1 row, not the whole table" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=15;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1000" y="475" width="440" height="46" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="23" value="Dev: 73.26 EM, 1.03 calls per question, tokens −26% vs. A1. Anchor rows for lookup only: enabled for every class, list questions drop 78 → 56." style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=15;fontStyle=2;fontColor=#555555;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="20" y="545" width="1420" height="30" as="geometry"/></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram></mxfile>